-Native-for-iOS/GeoJSON":{"title":"Working with GeoJSON Data","abstract":[],"role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/geojson","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GeoJSON","kind":"article"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNVectorTileSource":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnvectortilesource","abstract":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource"},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies tiled vector data"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"in "},{"type":"text","text":"Mapbox Vector Tile"},{"type":"text","text":" format"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"to be shown on the map. The location of and metadata about the tiles are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"defined either by an option dictionary or by an external file that conforms to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TileJSON specification"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A vector tile source is added to an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" object along with one or more","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" objects. A vector style layer defines the appearance of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"any content supplied by the vector tile source."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","title":"MLNVectorTileSource","fragments":[{"text":"MLNVectorTileSource","kind":"identifier"}]}}}